   intro="Many families in the Malwa heartland still search for VRL Packers and Movers Moga, and the company they knew now works as 1st VRL Packers and Movers. Moga is about 65 km from Ludhiana and around 175 km from Chandigarh; a verified partner team does the work here, while one coordinator from our Panchkula head office plans and tracks the move.",
