         ("Is a move from Kangra to Dharamshala a local move?","Yes. Dharamshala is the district headquarters, about 18 km up the road, so a move between the two is priced on the local band. A 1 BHK is roughly Rs 5,000 to 9,000 plus GST, with any hand carry at the hill end shown separately."),
