         ("Is Palwal to Faridabad charged as a local move?","No. Faridabad is a separate city about 30 km away and is not on our NCR local list for Palwal, so the move uses the up to 500 km band. A 1 BHK is roughly Rs 9,500 to 17,000 plus GST."),
